What is the degree measure of the smallest angle in triangle $PQS$? Provide your step-by-step solution to the problem. The final answer should be enclosed within \boxed{}, e.g. \boxed{n}.

In the diagram, $D$ and $E$ are the midpoints of $\overline{AB}$ and $\overline{BC}$ respectively.  Determine the area of quadrilateral $DBEF$. [asy]
size(180); defaultpen(linewidth(.7pt)+fontsize(10pt));
pair A, B, C, D, E, F;
A=(0,6);
B=(0,0);
C=(8,0);
D=(0,3);
E=(4,0);
F=(8/3,2);
draw(E--A--C--D);
draw((-1,0)--(10,0), EndArrow);
